    {
      "id": 28,
      "category_id": 11,
      "title": "Duʿa for a Joyous Household",
      "title_ar": null,
      "arabic": "رَبَّنَا هَبْ لَنَا مِنْ أَزْوَاجِنَا وَذُرِّيَّاتِنَا قُرَّةَ أَعْيُنٍ وَّاجْعَلْنَا لِلْمُتَّقِيْنَ إِمَامًا.",
      "transliteration": "Rabbanā hab lanā min azwājinā wa dhuriyyātinā qurrata aʿyuni-w-wajʿalnā lil-muttaqīna imāmā.",
      "translation": "Our Lord, grant us spouses and offspring who will be a joy to our eyes, and make us leaders of those who have taqwa (piety). (25:74)",
      "virtue": "",
      "reference": "",
